The Erdős Problem 956 upper-bound files (ErdosLean/Erdos956Upper/) do not include material from
third-party code. They reuse the statement file ErdosLean/Erdos956/Statement.lean of this
repository. The proof follows the published argument of P. Erdős and J. Pach (Combinatorica 10
(1990), 261-269) via the crossing lemma.
